{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "Integration Environment Contract",
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "schema_version",
    "integrations"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "schema_version": {
      "enum": [
        "integration-environment-contract/1.0"
      ]
    },
    "integrations": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "id",
          "enabled",
          "fields"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "enabled": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "env",
              "default"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "env": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "default": {
                "type": "boolean"
              }
            }
          },
          "fields": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "name",
                "env",
                "classification",
                "requiredWhenEnabled"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "name": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "env": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "classification": {
                  "enum": [
                    "PUBLIC_CONFIG",
                    "SECRET"
                  ]
                },
                "requiredWhenEnabled": {
                  "type": "boolean"
                },
                "legacyConfigKey": {
                  "type": [
                    "string",
                    "null"
                  ]
                },
                "format": {
                  "enum": [
                    "url",
                    "text"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "$id": "integration-environment-contract/1.0",
  "description": "El contrato de las variables de entorno de las integraciones del Bloque 1. Lo lee harnesses/desarrollo/bin/integraciones/entorno.py, que lo valida a mano con esta misma forma. Cada campo se clasifica PUBLIC_CONFIG o SECRET: un SECRET no se proyecta nunca. Divergencia con el paquete: `format` opcional en un campo (url), para validar la base URL."
}
